From 0275659d56a1d0a16b2db5d60d19f1d93fc0bc9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mratan <mattdratan@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 09:42:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] capture: port bsg100 harvest instrumentation (H18/H35
 trace format)

Verbatim port of the mirrored bsg100 patches 0002 (WMT/STP/BTIF debug
levels + HARVEST-WMT-TX/RX and HARVEST-BTIF-TX/RX hexdumps +
harvest_snap register snapshots), 0008 (harvest_snap mcu_powered guard
-- without it the reg_ctrl-on-entry snapshot reads CPUPCR in the
CONN_PERIPHERALS DEVAPC domain before the block is powered and
hard-resets the board, bsg100 H16 finding) and 0003 (never mute the
UART console under printk.disable_uart) from their Kali
gemini-android-kernel-3.18 tree onto the gemian native tree; only the
kernel-3.18/ path prefix was stripped -- every 0002/0003 hunk applied
clean, confirming the shared lineage. Keeps the C1 trace
byte-format-diffable against the mirrored H18/H35 golden traces.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
